id: MOD5-1
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: round_slice_init
target: crates/core/src/begin.rs
find:     state.run.completed = false;
replace:     state.run.completed = false; state.run.world.clear();
expect-fail: mod5_world_hash_is_unchanged_by_begin_after_round1
note: 次の周回の開始が世界状態を消す（開始の前後で世界状態のハッシュが変わる）
